1
00:01:36,870 --> 00:01:38,850
[The Lament of Autumn]

2
00:01:39,470 --> 00:01:41,640
[Episode 1]

3
00:01:44,259 --> 00:01:45,930
[8th Year of Republic of China]

4
00:01:45,930 --> 00:01:47,640
[Hundreds of thousands of young men]

5
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:50,259
[defined patriotism with passion.]

6
00:01:50,759 --> 00:01:53,650
[This revolutionary spirit is like
a guiding light in the darkness.]

7
00:01:50,800 --> 00:01:51,330
[Civil war ruins a nation;
peace builds a nation]

8
00:01:51,430 --> 00:01:52,930
[Da Feng Bank]

9
00:01:53,039 --> 00:01:54,620
[Nanhuai]

10
00:01:53,920 --> 00:01:56,450
[It lights up the gates to
a new era of China.]

11
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:58,350
[At the end of the same year,]

12
00:01:58,350 --> 00:02:00,200
[the acting president died of illness.]

13
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:02,280
[The leader of the northern warlords,
Cheng Jun,]

14
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:04,340
[plotted to assume the presidency,]

15
00:02:04,590 --> 00:02:07,850
[and proposed the idea of a coalition
to various regions.]

16
00:02:08,130 --> 00:02:09,910
[In an era of clashing ideologies]

17
00:02:08,169 --> 00:02:11,850
[Yu]

18
00:02:10,130 --> 00:02:12,060
[and power struggles,]

19
00:02:12,310 --> 00:02:13,910
[the old gives way to the new]

20
00:02:14,080 --> 00:02:16,210
[and light and darkness intertwine.]

21
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:18,370
The Commander-in-Chief has arrived!

22
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:27,430
Greetings, Commander-in-Chief!

23
00:02:37,110 --> 00:02:39,680
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

24
00:02:38,900 --> 00:02:39,760
As you all know,

25
00:02:40,430 --> 00:02:42,530
Third Master Cheng and Premier Rui

26
00:02:42,530 --> 00:02:44,390
are fighting for the presidency.

27
00:02:44,530 --> 00:02:46,740
Military Governor Chu
is his direct subordinate,

28
00:02:46,740 --> 00:02:47,910
so of course he agreed.

29
00:02:47,910 --> 00:02:50,950
[Yu]

30
00:02:48,740 --> 00:02:49,780
But Commander Mou

31
00:02:50,340 --> 00:02:51,470
politely declined.

32
00:02:52,590 --> 00:02:54,240
Regarding the coalition,

33
00:02:55,860 --> 00:02:57,130
what do you all think?

34
00:03:00,360 --> 00:03:01,970
The Mou family has been
growing stronger these years.

35
00:03:01,970 --> 00:03:03,030
Their wings have hardened,

36
00:03:03,030 --> 00:03:06,960
and they now want to stand on
equal footing with Military Governor Chu.

37
00:03:07,090 --> 00:03:08,280
In my opinion,

38
00:03:08,900 --> 00:03:11,280
Premier Rui has been at the helm of
the central government for many years

39
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,500
and has deep roots there.

40
00:03:12,450 --> 00:03:15,000
[Yu]

41
00:03:13,750 --> 00:03:15,370
As for this Third Master Cheng,

42
00:03:15,370 --> 00:03:17,900
he was just a destitute man
in his early years,

43
00:03:18,079 --> 00:03:19,940
making a living by selling cloth.

44
00:03:20,340 --> 00:03:21,460
Later, he relied on

45
00:03:21,460 --> 00:03:22,910
that old monkey, Mr. Wu,

46
00:03:23,060 --> 00:03:24,180
to make his fortune.

47
00:03:24,180 --> 00:03:26,130
With such a foundation,

48
00:03:26,930 --> 00:03:28,930
how can he compete with Premier Rui?

49
00:03:30,150 --> 00:03:31,750
We may have our own concerns,

50
00:03:33,340 --> 00:03:35,150
but we are all just afraid of
betting on the wrong person

51
00:03:35,150 --> 00:03:36,480
and losing our capital.

52
00:03:36,650 --> 00:03:38,800
But the current central government

53
00:03:39,150 --> 00:03:41,800
is already a revolving door.

54
00:03:42,060 --> 00:03:44,060
If we just watch from the sidelines,

55
00:03:44,650 --> 00:03:47,110
I'm afraid there will be
no seats left for us.

56
00:03:48,060 --> 00:03:49,650
In this great game of life,

57
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:51,740
if you don't make a move,

58
00:03:52,750 --> 00:03:54,460
you will never win.

59
00:03:55,079 --> 00:03:56,090
I think...

60
00:03:57,900 --> 00:03:59,000
this risk

61
00:03:59,530 --> 00:04:00,650
is worth taking.

62
00:04:08,210 --> 00:04:09,810
We don't need to be too conservative.

63
00:04:09,810 --> 00:04:10,590
What's going on?

64
00:04:10,590 --> 00:04:12,190
Where did this bird come from?

65
00:04:12,190 --> 00:04:13,340
What's going on?

66
00:04:14,090 --> 00:04:14,750
Commander,

67
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:15,960
this is the parrot raised by

68
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:17,420
Fifth Young Master in the office.

69
00:04:17,420 --> 00:04:18,680
How absrud.

70
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:20,500
Yes, it's ridiculous.

71
00:04:21,060 --> 00:04:22,930
Tell him to come see me immediately.

72
00:04:22,930 --> 00:04:23,660
Commander,

73
00:04:24,330 --> 00:04:25,560
Fifth Young Master asked for leave

74
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:28,160
and hasn't been in the army
these past few days.

75
00:04:28,930 --> 00:04:30,250
That scoundrel!

76
00:04:33,030 --> 00:04:34,890
[Xiangxi Hotel]

77
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:40,560
This way, please.

78
00:04:41,830 --> 00:04:44,159
Open! Open! Open!

79
00:05:02,740 --> 00:05:05,270
Fifth Young Master Yu's luck
has been so good!

80
00:05:05,640 --> 00:05:07,640
Yes, he's completely unstoppable.

81
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,860
Thank you, Fifth Young Master Yu.

82
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:18,950
Yes.

83
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:22,830
Game!

84
00:05:23,470 --> 00:05:25,400
Great luck, Fifth Young Master Yu!

85
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:27,840
Winning just this much is no fun.

86
00:05:27,950 --> 00:05:30,090
I'll pay all three of you this round.

87
00:05:30,660 --> 00:05:32,540
I'll double whatever you lost.

88
00:05:32,980 --> 00:05:33,970
Great!

89
00:05:34,100 --> 00:05:35,390
How generous, Fifth Young Master Yu!

90
00:05:35,390 --> 00:05:37,070
Come, come!

91
00:05:39,010 --> 00:05:39,680
See that?

92
00:05:40,250 --> 00:05:42,780
Now that’s what I call
a broad-minded person!

93
00:05:42,909 --> 00:05:43,960
If you ask me,

94
00:05:44,070 --> 00:05:45,659
with the Fifth Young Master Yu's luck,

95
00:05:45,659 --> 00:05:46,300
in addition to

96
00:05:46,300 --> 00:05:48,010
this grand spectacle today,

97
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:49,120
let alone us

98
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,010
playing cards together,

99
00:05:50,010 --> 00:05:51,010
no matter who you bring in,

100
00:05:51,010 --> 00:05:51,810
they'd lose everything they have.

101
00:05:51,810 --> 00:05:52,180
Believe it or not?

102
00:05:52,180 --> 00:05:53,120
I believe, I believe.

103
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:54,180
He is unstoppable.

104
00:05:56,180 --> 00:05:57,159
A useless card.

105
00:05:57,659 --> 00:05:58,920
I'll let you guys pong.

106
00:05:59,510 --> 00:06:00,010
Pong?

107
00:06:02,060 --> 00:06:03,260
Here in Nanhuai City,

108
00:06:03,370 --> 00:06:05,330
being able to play a round of mahjong
with Fifth Young Master Yu

109
00:06:05,330 --> 00:06:07,630
is an honor earned over several lifetimes.

110
00:06:07,630 --> 00:06:08,470
Absolutely.

111
00:06:09,130 --> 00:06:10,510
Speaking of which,

112
00:06:10,830 --> 00:06:11,920
I have a cousin

113
00:06:12,190 --> 00:06:14,250
who has worked in the logistics department
for 5 years.

114
00:06:14,250 --> 00:06:15,860
He's very honest

115
00:06:16,190 --> 00:06:18,100
and has always wanted to transfer to
the transportation department.

116
00:06:18,100 --> 00:06:19,760
He just lacks an opportunity.

117
00:06:20,160 --> 00:06:21,760
I hope the Fifth Young Master

118
00:06:21,770 --> 00:06:22,560
can help him out.

119
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:24,220
What's the use of coming to me?

120
00:06:24,510 --> 00:06:26,120
I just happen to be with
the staff department,

121
00:06:26,120 --> 00:06:27,450
holding an empty title.

122
00:06:27,500 --> 00:06:29,000
Look at what you're saying.

123
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:29,390
You are

124
00:06:29,390 --> 00:06:31,450
the crown prince of our Nanhuai City.

125
00:06:33,270 --> 00:06:34,370
Fifth Young Master Yu,

126
00:06:34,370 --> 00:06:35,659
next Wednesday evening,

127
00:06:35,659 --> 00:06:37,730
my uncle's bank is hosting a banquet.

128
00:06:37,980 --> 00:06:40,060
I beg you to do us the honor of
taking the main seat.

129
00:06:40,060 --> 00:06:41,790
You just have to show your face.

130
00:07:03,310 --> 00:07:07,680
[Yu’s Residence]

131
00:07:06,740 --> 00:07:07,500
Mingxuan.

132
00:07:07,740 --> 00:07:14,130
[Memorial Tablet of Beloved Son,
Yu Mingxuan]

133
00:07:08,540 --> 00:07:09,770
It's getting cold.

134
00:07:10,500 --> 00:07:12,040
I am burning you

135
00:07:12,390 --> 00:07:14,070
a hat and a scarf.

136
00:07:14,500 --> 00:07:15,830
Remember to put them on.

137
00:07:18,180 --> 00:07:20,680
I went to Tianjin Street today

138
00:07:21,870 --> 00:07:23,680
and bought your favorite

139
00:07:24,330 --> 00:07:25,260
tangerine cake.

140
00:07:27,100 --> 00:07:28,360
After all these years,

141
00:07:29,540 --> 00:07:31,740
nothing has changed on Tianjin Street.

142
00:07:32,570 --> 00:07:34,190
Only my son

143
00:07:35,810 --> 00:07:36,870
is gone.

144
00:07:50,610 --> 00:07:53,159
[The Lotus Sutra]

145
00:07:52,330 --> 00:07:53,659
Rest assured, brother.

146
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:55,480
As a son-in-law of the Yu family,

147
00:07:56,070 --> 00:07:58,670
I will definitely take good care
of the family.

148
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:30,740
Changxuan, slow down!

149
00:08:31,630 --> 00:08:32,760
Fifth Young Master!

150
00:08:32,820 --> 00:08:34,549
Fifth Young Master, are you alright?

151
00:08:34,549 --> 00:08:35,210
Stop there!

152
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:39,080
Come in!

153
00:08:50,500 --> 00:08:51,500
Everyone's here?

154
00:08:52,890 --> 00:08:54,790
What is that on your cheek?

155
00:08:58,290 --> 00:08:59,820
That's a woman's lipstick!

156
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:02,110
All you do every day

157
00:09:02,290 --> 00:09:03,370
is to fool around,

158
00:09:03,650 --> 00:09:04,870
eat, drink, and play.

159
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:05,960
What a disgrace!

160
00:09:06,410 --> 00:09:07,000
Zhou Tai!

161
00:09:07,120 --> 00:09:07,650
I'm here.

162
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:08,620
Bring the family cane.

163
00:09:08,620 --> 00:09:09,170
Yes.

164
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:12,460
No need to bother.

165
00:09:12,910 --> 00:09:14,770
You just want to hit me, don't you?

166
00:09:15,290 --> 00:09:16,240
Come on.

167
00:09:17,750 --> 00:09:19,700
If he hadn't lost two sons,

168
00:09:20,960 --> 00:09:23,220
he would have beaten me to death long ago.

169
00:09:34,500 --> 00:09:35,230
Dad!

170
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:38,410
Dad!

171
00:09:38,410 --> 00:09:39,670
Don't hit him!

172
00:09:39,670 --> 00:09:41,220
Your hand has no sense of moderation.

173
00:09:41,220 --> 00:09:42,240
If you hurt him,

174
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:43,200
I won't live either.

175
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:43,600
Get up!

176
00:09:43,620 --> 00:09:44,750
-Carry on!
-No!

177
00:09:44,790 --> 00:09:45,360
I'll beat you to death!

178
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:46,570
I'm never letting you off!

179
00:09:46,570 --> 00:09:48,250
Don't!

180
00:09:49,100 --> 00:09:49,720
Get up!

181
00:09:50,320 --> 00:09:51,480
Mom! Mom!

182
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:54,470
Stop hitting him, Yu Zhongquan!

183
00:09:54,520 --> 00:09:56,940
I had three sons, and two are dead.

184
00:09:57,010 --> 00:09:59,410
This is my only remaining heir.

185
00:09:59,500 --> 00:10:00,410
Let him go!

186
00:10:00,460 --> 00:10:01,720
If you beat him to death,

187
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:04,480
you'll truly be all alone!

188
00:10:11,010 --> 00:10:12,210
It's okay, don't cry.

189
00:10:12,790 --> 00:10:13,600
Commander.

190
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:14,700
Stop hitting him.

191
00:10:14,700 --> 00:10:16,300
Look, Wanxuan is terrified.

192
00:10:16,700 --> 00:10:18,120
Why are you all just standing there?

193
00:10:18,120 --> 00:10:19,580
Hurry up and get him back to his room!

194
00:10:19,580 --> 00:10:20,500
Hurry, hurry.

195
00:10:21,500 --> 00:10:22,030
Let's go.

196
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:43,200
Bear with it.

197
00:10:43,700 --> 00:10:45,200
Just bear a while more.

198
00:10:48,460 --> 00:10:50,290
I worked so hard

199
00:10:50,580 --> 00:10:52,290
to raise three sons,

200
00:10:52,650 --> 00:10:54,500
and now only this one is left.

201
00:10:56,790 --> 00:10:58,550
Mom, don't be sad anymore.

202
00:10:59,050 --> 00:11:00,710
Here's some bruise ointment.

203
00:11:07,510 --> 00:11:08,620
Bear with it.

204
00:11:15,790 --> 00:11:17,250
It's also hard on Minru.

205
00:11:19,390 --> 00:11:22,590
She had only been married into
the Yu family for two months

206
00:11:23,250 --> 00:11:25,100
when Mingxuan died in battle.

207
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:30,660
The Yu family has let you down.

208
00:11:32,050 --> 00:11:33,360
I know well in my heart.

209
00:11:35,460 --> 00:11:36,120
Mom,

210
00:11:36,820 --> 00:11:38,030
since I am married into the Yu family,

211
00:11:38,030 --> 00:11:39,530
I am therefore a member of the Yu family.

212
00:11:39,530 --> 00:11:40,320
There is no such thing

213
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:41,380
as letting me down.

214
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:44,000
I know you care about Changxuan,

215
00:11:44,390 --> 00:11:45,050
but...

216
00:11:45,220 --> 00:11:45,790
you also need to take good care

217
00:11:45,790 --> 00:11:46,850
of your own health.

218
00:11:47,700 --> 00:11:48,390
Say no more.

219
00:11:50,200 --> 00:11:50,750
Mom,

220
00:11:51,390 --> 00:11:54,250
frankly, Changxuan deserves
to be taught a lesson.

221
00:11:54,250 --> 00:11:56,110
Look at Xiao Beichen from Beixin.

222
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:58,010
He's only a year or two older than him,

223
00:11:58,010 --> 00:12:00,050
but on the battlefield,
he is a brilliant strategist

224
00:12:00,050 --> 00:12:01,110
who is invincible.

225
00:12:01,910 --> 00:12:03,240
Then look at Changxuan.

226
00:12:03,410 --> 00:12:04,870
What a good-for-nothing!

227
00:12:05,410 --> 00:12:07,200
Yu Qixuan, can you get out?

228
00:12:07,290 --> 00:12:08,600
Your voice annoys me.

229
00:12:09,820 --> 00:12:10,880
Exactly.

230
00:12:11,100 --> 00:12:12,880
Why do you always compare others

231
00:12:12,880 --> 00:12:15,090
with your own brother?

232
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:17,060
He has a headache. Get out.

233
00:12:17,600 --> 00:12:18,400
Fine, I'll go.

234
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:20,730
I'm considered annoying here anyway.

235
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:23,290
Mom, I'm fine.

236
00:12:23,410 --> 00:12:24,010
Just go.

237
00:12:24,010 --> 00:12:25,200
All of you go.

238
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:26,000
Okay, okay.

239
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:27,430
We'll all leave. Let's go.

240
00:12:27,430 --> 00:12:28,020
Come.

241
00:12:29,390 --> 00:12:31,720
Come find me quickly if anything happens.

242
00:12:45,050 --> 00:12:45,700
Ruitong.

243
00:12:47,870 --> 00:12:48,870
Get the car ready.

244
00:12:59,820 --> 00:13:00,620
Commander.

245
00:13:02,700 --> 00:13:03,910
Please calm down.

246
00:13:07,010 --> 00:13:07,910
No need.

247
00:13:08,890 --> 00:13:10,720
I haven't lost my mind from anger.

248
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:13,000
At that critical moment,

249
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:14,930
Wanxuan suddenly started crying.

250
00:13:15,500 --> 00:13:17,100
You pinched her, didn't you?

251
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:21,170
I just didn't want you to get angry.

252
00:13:23,010 --> 00:13:23,860
I know.

253
00:13:24,460 --> 00:13:26,910
It's perfectly justified for you
to discipline Changxuan.

254
00:13:26,910 --> 00:13:28,100
Being strict with him

255
00:13:28,100 --> 00:13:29,360
is for his own good.

256
00:13:30,220 --> 00:13:32,620
But you shouldn't ruin
your health over it.

257
00:13:32,650 --> 00:13:33,910
After all, this family

258
00:13:34,290 --> 00:13:36,150
relies on you to hold it together.

259
00:13:54,840 --> 00:13:55,500
Changxuan.

260
00:13:58,340 --> 00:13:59,750
The rain is getting heavier.

261
00:13:59,750 --> 00:14:00,670
The mountain road to Guanyin Pavilion

262
00:14:00,670 --> 00:14:02,230
might be challenging to travel on.

263
00:14:02,230 --> 00:14:02,860
Are we still going to

264
00:14:02,860 --> 00:14:04,660
pay respects to Mingxuan today?

265
00:14:12,820 --> 00:14:13,460
Forget it.

266
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:14,800
Let's go back.

267
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:17,730
Turn around.

268
00:14:26,910 --> 00:14:27,770
What happened?

269
00:14:28,500 --> 00:14:30,160
Someone suddenly rushed out.

270
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:31,180
Did we hit them?

271
00:14:32,530 --> 00:14:33,460
I don't think so.

272
00:14:35,090 --> 00:14:38,220
But she seems to have dropped things
all over the ground.

273
00:14:43,940 --> 00:14:44,670
5.

274
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:51,200
6.

275
00:14:53,670 --> 00:14:54,600
7.

276
00:15:00,370 --> 00:15:01,340
8.

277
00:15:05,360 --> 00:15:06,200
9.

278
00:15:13,360 --> 00:15:14,120
10.

279
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:44,000
Thank you.

280
00:16:27,760 --> 00:16:29,150
[Mingde Girls' High School]

281
00:16:33,620 --> 00:16:34,550
[Jiguang Tower,
Mingde Girls' High School]

282
00:16:43,240 --> 00:16:44,130
Xueting.

283
00:16:44,820 --> 00:16:47,220
Mother and I are both looking forward to
late autumn,

284
00:16:47,220 --> 00:16:49,620
when you return from
your studies in Tokyo.

285
00:16:49,890 --> 00:16:52,740
We've kept in touch through letters
these past 4 years.

286
00:16:52,740 --> 00:16:54,910
It’s as if it were you,
the one who grew up with me,

287
00:16:54,910 --> 00:16:56,180
never went far away.

288
00:17:03,620 --> 00:17:04,420
Pingjun!

289
00:17:08,460 --> 00:17:09,369
Slow down.

290
00:17:09,400 --> 00:17:09,849
Here.

291
00:17:10,740 --> 00:17:11,550
Take these.

292
00:17:12,480 --> 00:17:13,339
Hold on to them.

293
00:17:13,440 --> 00:17:14,140
When I get home,

294
00:17:14,140 --> 00:17:16,140
I'll ask my father for a little more.

295
00:17:16,310 --> 00:17:17,810
No, I can't accept this.

296
00:17:17,880 --> 00:17:19,960
I can't always rely on
your financial support.

297
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:21,609
Why are you acting like a stranger?

298
00:17:21,609 --> 00:17:22,920
Your mother's lung disease has flared up,

299
00:17:22,920 --> 00:17:24,510
and this is exactly when
you need money the most.

300
00:17:24,510 --> 00:17:25,640
Hurry up and take it.

301
00:17:26,030 --> 00:17:28,109
Then when I find a job,

302
00:17:28,240 --> 00:17:29,240
I'll pay you back.

303
00:17:30,700 --> 00:17:31,830
I'll get going then.

304
00:17:31,880 --> 00:17:32,530
Take care.

305
00:18:06,290 --> 00:18:11,060
[Da Hua Department Store]

306
00:18:11,830 --> 00:18:12,790
The next item

307
00:18:12,980 --> 00:18:14,380
is the highlight

308
00:18:14,530 --> 00:18:16,200
of this auction.

309
00:18:17,880 --> 00:18:19,210
Everyone, please look.

310
00:18:25,290 --> 00:18:26,370
This piece of jewelry

311
00:18:26,370 --> 00:18:27,030
was once collected by

312
00:18:27,030 --> 00:18:28,880
a Russian duchess.

313
00:18:29,070 --> 00:18:31,610
Even after a century, it remains dazzling.

314
00:18:31,830 --> 00:18:32,380
Now,

315
00:18:32,570 --> 00:18:33,830
let the bidding begin.

316
00:18:34,030 --> 00:18:34,570
Miss Tao,

317
00:18:35,380 --> 00:18:36,180
do you like it?

318
00:18:37,270 --> 00:18:38,070
It's alright.

319
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:40,590
Miss Tao, if you like it,

320
00:18:40,980 --> 00:18:42,380
how about I bid it for you?

321
00:18:47,290 --> 00:18:47,900
Ziyi.

322
00:18:48,530 --> 00:18:49,790
This guy surnamed Tong

323
00:18:50,270 --> 00:18:52,980
is all show with no substance.

324
00:18:53,530 --> 00:18:55,180
He said he went to study abroad,

325
00:18:55,180 --> 00:18:57,070
but he didn't learn any real skills.

326
00:18:57,070 --> 00:18:59,730
Instead, he became an expert in
all things vice.

327
00:19:00,140 --> 00:19:01,800
The starting price is 50,000.

328
00:19:02,140 --> 00:19:03,220
Let the bidding begin.

329
00:19:03,220 --> 00:19:03,850
60,000.

330
00:19:04,270 --> 00:19:06,030
Mr. Tong bids 60,000.

331
00:19:06,290 --> 00:19:07,050
100,000.

332
00:19:07,940 --> 00:19:08,740
110,000.

333
00:19:09,140 --> 00:19:09,850
140,000.

334
00:19:09,980 --> 00:19:10,790
160,000.

335
00:19:11,090 --> 00:19:11,850
400,000.

336
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:13,920
400,000.

337
00:19:14,440 --> 00:19:15,640
The bid is at 400,000!

338
00:19:17,000 --> 00:19:18,180
Any higher bids?

339
00:19:20,850 --> 00:19:21,750
450,000!

340
00:19:22,350 --> 00:19:23,160
400...

341
00:19:23,290 --> 00:19:24,440
450,000!

342
00:19:28,050 --> 00:19:29,420
450,000 going once.

343
00:19:30,290 --> 00:19:32,130
450,000 going twice.

344
00:19:32,500 --> 00:19:33,640
450,000...

345
00:19:34,590 --> 00:19:35,390
going thrice!

346
00:19:36,240 --> 00:19:37,250
Congratulations, Mr. Tong,

347
00:19:37,250 --> 00:19:38,450
on winning this item!

348
00:19:43,550 --> 00:19:44,480
What's the rush?

349
00:19:58,980 --> 00:20:00,510
It's Fifth Young Master Yu.

350
00:20:20,190 --> 00:20:21,390
What did I tell you?

351
00:20:21,750 --> 00:20:22,950
Knowing you're here,

352
00:20:23,090 --> 00:20:25,090
Yu Changxuan would definitely come.

353
00:20:25,090 --> 00:20:25,940
Fifth Young Master Yu,

354
00:20:25,940 --> 00:20:26,670
you're here.

355
00:20:26,980 --> 00:20:28,440
This item looks good.

356
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:31,200
This item has already been sold.

357
00:20:31,790 --> 00:20:33,050
There are better ones coming up.

358
00:20:33,050 --> 00:20:34,850
Would you mind looking at those?

359
00:20:35,900 --> 00:20:37,030
Isn't that simple?

360
00:20:38,160 --> 00:20:39,690
Put it up for auction again.

361
00:20:42,000 --> 00:20:43,260
Fifth Young Master Yu,

362
00:20:43,900 --> 00:20:45,500
we have rules to follow here.

363
00:20:46,030 --> 00:20:47,490
Since I've already won it,

364
00:20:47,550 --> 00:20:50,010
how can you simply ask to
have it auctioned again?

365
00:20:50,010 --> 00:20:51,810
Aren't you being too demanding?

366
00:21:06,920 --> 00:21:08,320
What exactly do you want?

367
00:21:09,700 --> 00:21:12,250
I heard Mr. Tong just returned from
studying abroad.

368
00:21:12,250 --> 00:21:13,010
No wonder.

369
00:21:15,050 --> 00:21:16,090
In Nanhuai City,

370
00:21:17,220 --> 00:21:17,830
I've never seen

371
00:21:17,830 --> 00:21:19,090
anyone as gutsy as you.

372
00:21:19,900 --> 00:21:20,760
So I've decided

373
00:21:22,420 --> 00:21:23,610
to auction off

374
00:21:25,350 --> 00:21:26,490
your pride today.

375
00:21:33,480 --> 00:21:35,210
Auctioning me off like an item?

376
00:21:35,720 --> 00:21:36,980
Starting price is 500.

377
00:21:37,480 --> 00:21:38,740
Let the auction begin.

378
00:21:49,500 --> 00:21:51,240
So this is Xiangxi Hotel.

379
00:21:58,720 --> 00:22:00,360
Hello, do you need any help?

380
00:22:02,480 --> 00:22:04,830
Hello, I'm here for a job interview.

381
00:22:05,140 --> 00:22:06,270
Go up to the 2nd floor from here,

382
00:22:06,270 --> 00:22:07,570
walk to the end of the left corridor,

383
00:22:07,570 --> 00:22:08,740
then turn left with the crowd,

384
00:22:08,740 --> 00:22:09,180
and you'll see

385
00:22:09,180 --> 00:22:10,840
the office for the interview.

386
00:22:14,350 --> 00:22:15,420
Annoying.

387
00:22:18,590 --> 00:22:19,290
Hurry up.

388
00:22:19,480 --> 00:22:22,010
There are so many people
interviewing today.

389
00:22:22,350 --> 00:22:23,400
I'm so nervous.

390
00:22:23,400 --> 00:22:25,250
Why are they hiring so few people?

391
00:22:25,250 --> 00:22:26,850
I heard they're look to hire
only 4 people today.

392
00:22:26,850 --> 00:22:28,380
I've been waiting forever.

393
00:22:28,660 --> 00:22:30,700
[Recruitment Room]

394
00:22:29,900 --> 00:22:31,610
My father belongs to the Yu Army,

395
00:22:31,610 --> 00:22:33,500
1st Regiment, 2nd Brigade, 3rd Division.

396
00:22:33,500 --> 00:22:34,760
He's a platoon leader.

397
00:22:34,810 --> 00:22:36,270
Do you have any relatives

398
00:22:36,460 --> 00:22:38,050
serving in the military?

399
00:22:38,900 --> 00:22:39,500
My uncle

400
00:22:39,500 --> 00:22:41,560
works at the Secretariat of the Army.

401
00:22:42,220 --> 00:22:43,420
The Secretariat?

402
00:22:43,650 --> 00:22:45,310
[Xiangxi Hotel Interview Application]
[Name: Zhou Yanchu]

403
00:22:45,720 --> 00:22:47,310
Your father passed away early,

404
00:22:47,310 --> 00:22:49,440
and you are only left with your mother?

405
00:22:50,790 --> 00:22:51,590
Yes.

406
00:22:51,610 --> 00:22:53,670
Does your family own any businesses?

407
00:22:53,700 --> 00:22:55,830
We don't own any as an ordinary family.

408
00:23:01,220 --> 00:23:02,660
I worked at a French restaurant

409
00:23:02,660 --> 00:23:03,660
for a year,

410
00:23:03,770 --> 00:23:05,420
mainly as a receptionist.

411
00:23:05,450 --> 00:23:06,610
I am fluent in

412
00:23:06,610 --> 00:23:07,700
English and French,

413
00:23:07,700 --> 00:23:09,530
know a bit about Western dining etiquette,

414
00:23:09,530 --> 00:23:11,530
and am quite familiar with
Western cuisine.

415
00:23:11,530 --> 00:23:13,090
If you give me this job,

416
00:23:13,200 --> 00:23:15,000
I will do my absolute best.

417
00:23:24,460 --> 00:23:26,700
100. Any bids?

418
00:23:26,750 --> 00:23:28,610
100 is simply embarrassing.

419
00:23:28,630 --> 00:23:30,660
50. Any bids?

420
00:23:36,090 --> 00:23:38,770
40. Anyone?

421
00:23:39,480 --> 00:23:40,700
Who would dare to bid?

422
00:23:40,810 --> 00:23:43,610
That would be going against
Fifth Young Master Yu.

423
00:23:46,350 --> 00:23:48,520
30. Any bids?

424
00:23:55,090 --> 00:23:57,550
1 dollar. Any bids?

425
00:23:57,610 --> 00:23:59,920
1 dollar? That is ridiculous.

426
00:23:59,920 --> 00:24:01,720
That's as good as giving it away.

427
00:24:02,290 --> 00:24:04,200
No one wants to buy it even for a dollar.

428
00:24:04,200 --> 00:24:05,180
I announce

429
00:24:05,700 --> 00:24:06,810
that with no bids,

430
00:24:07,220 --> 00:24:08,350
Mr. Tong's pride

431
00:24:10,110 --> 00:24:10,840
goes unsold.

432
00:24:31,290 --> 00:24:32,090
Pride

433
00:24:33,850 --> 00:24:35,720
is worthless to me.

434
00:24:38,310 --> 00:24:39,710
Can you just be obedient?

435
00:24:41,940 --> 00:24:42,380
Yes.

436
00:24:50,380 --> 00:24:51,790
Whatever he paid for it,

437
00:24:52,960 --> 00:24:54,220
I'll buy it for double.

438
00:24:56,240 --> 00:24:58,440
I heard a batch of whiskey just arrived.

439
00:24:58,570 --> 00:24:59,830
Yes, Fifth Young Master Yu.

440
00:24:59,830 --> 00:25:01,760
It just got shipped from Scotland.

441
00:25:02,510 --> 00:25:04,040
A bottle for everyone here.

442
00:25:04,480 --> 00:25:05,190
It's on me.

443
00:25:06,350 --> 00:25:08,410
How generous, Fifth Young Master Yu.

444
00:25:08,980 --> 00:25:10,840
Thank you, Fifth Young Master Yu!

445
00:25:19,880 --> 00:25:20,550
Hi!

446
00:25:21,660 --> 00:25:22,220
Hello.

447
00:25:22,980 --> 00:25:24,200
I'd like to know

448
00:25:24,240 --> 00:25:25,510
why I wasn't selected.

449
00:25:27,550 --> 00:25:29,080
Let me put it this way, miss.

450
00:25:29,570 --> 00:25:31,430
A person's outlook and worldview

451
00:25:31,440 --> 00:25:33,700
are related to one's family background.

452
00:25:33,920 --> 00:25:34,790
For example,

453
00:25:35,050 --> 00:25:36,400
take our hotel.

454
00:25:37,030 --> 00:25:39,070
We are the first hotel in the city

455
00:25:39,070 --> 00:25:41,270
to introduce indoor golf.

456
00:25:41,460 --> 00:25:42,610
This kind of western novelty,

457
00:25:42,610 --> 00:25:44,350
popular among foreign aristocrats,

458
00:25:44,350 --> 00:25:46,420
is something many people
have never even seen.

459
00:25:46,420 --> 00:25:48,270
If you make a fool of yourself,

460
00:25:48,980 --> 00:25:50,710
people might not remember you,

461
00:25:50,920 --> 00:25:52,050
but they will definitely remember

462
00:25:52,050 --> 00:25:54,680
that it was Xiangxi Hotel's fault.

463
00:25:57,610 --> 00:25:59,850
Actually, golf

464
00:26:00,050 --> 00:26:00,590
originated from

465
00:26:00,590 --> 00:26:02,650
a game played by Scottish shepherds.

466
00:26:02,680 --> 00:26:04,240
While herding sheep,

467
00:26:04,310 --> 00:26:05,810
they used the handles of their crooks

468
00:26:05,810 --> 00:26:06,960
to hit round stones

469
00:26:06,960 --> 00:26:08,160
into rabbit holes.

470
00:26:08,400 --> 00:26:09,550
It has absolutely nothing

471
00:26:09,550 --> 00:26:10,880
to do with aristocrats.

472
00:26:19,610 --> 00:26:20,210
By the way,

473
00:26:20,640 --> 00:26:21,980
when I arrived, I saw

474
00:26:22,140 --> 00:26:23,590
a Western-style oil painting of

475
00:26:23,590 --> 00:26:25,570
a ball at the Sudanese royal palace

476
00:26:25,570 --> 00:26:27,200
hanging in the center of the lobby.

477
00:26:27,200 --> 00:26:28,600
You have a good eye, miss.

478
00:26:29,010 --> 00:26:30,510
I picked it out myself.

479
00:26:30,660 --> 00:26:32,320
It just got hung up yesterday.

480
00:26:32,380 --> 00:26:33,380
What do you think?

481
00:26:33,460 --> 00:26:36,070
The people in that painting
are dressed luxuriously,

482
00:26:36,070 --> 00:26:37,380
dancing to their hearts' content.

483
00:26:37,380 --> 00:26:39,180
But what it really depicts

484
00:26:39,270 --> 00:26:41,270
are assassins hiding in the shadows,

485
00:26:41,270 --> 00:26:42,610
which symbolizes danger.

486
00:26:42,610 --> 00:26:44,870
If a guest who understands art sees it...

487
00:26:46,610 --> 00:26:48,740
I'm afraid it might be inappropriate.

488
00:26:48,980 --> 00:26:50,310
So that's what it means.

489
00:26:52,550 --> 00:26:53,850
Thank you for the reminder, miss.

490
00:26:53,850 --> 00:26:56,180
I'll have someone take it down right away.

491
00:27:02,460 --> 00:27:03,250
Miss Ye.

492
00:27:04,700 --> 00:27:05,430
Please wait.

493
00:27:08,960 --> 00:27:10,270
You are?

494
00:27:12,480 --> 00:27:13,680
My friends flatter me

495
00:27:14,250 --> 00:27:15,650
by calling me Master Jin.

496
00:27:15,850 --> 00:27:17,160
I'm the boss here.

497
00:27:17,740 --> 00:27:18,250
I just heard

498
00:27:18,250 --> 00:27:20,180
you speak very elegantly, Miss Ye.

499
00:27:20,270 --> 00:27:21,980
I would like to hire you, Miss Ye,

500
00:27:21,980 --> 00:27:23,440
to try some clerical work.

501
00:27:24,250 --> 00:27:25,850
I wonder if you'd be willing?

502
00:27:26,270 --> 00:27:27,070
I would be!

503
00:27:27,750 --> 00:27:28,880
To be honest,

504
00:27:29,070 --> 00:27:30,570
I really need this job.

505
00:27:31,090 --> 00:27:31,750
Master Jin.

506
00:27:33,460 --> 00:27:34,940
Fifth Young Master Yu
wants to dance all night.

507
00:27:34,940 --> 00:27:37,000
We are short of hands in the Lido Hall.

508
00:27:38,180 --> 00:27:40,660
Transfer some people from
Yongan Hall first.

509
00:27:40,660 --> 00:27:42,390
I'm going to Shenyang tonight.

510
00:27:43,110 --> 00:27:44,980
Tell the foreman to
keep a close eye on things.

511
00:27:44,980 --> 00:27:45,510
Yes, Sir.

512
00:27:49,810 --> 00:27:51,480
If Miss Ye has time tonight,

513
00:27:52,380 --> 00:27:53,910
you can also go and help out.

514
00:27:54,050 --> 00:27:55,850
Fifth Young Master Yu's parties

515
00:27:55,900 --> 00:27:56,720
pay very well.

516
00:27:57,830 --> 00:27:58,500
I can do it.

517
00:27:58,740 --> 00:28:00,000
Thank you, Master Jin.

518
00:28:41,070 --> 00:28:42,850
Then I'll be looking forward to it.

519
00:28:42,850 --> 00:28:45,050
Second Young Lady Tao, let me toast you.

520
00:28:46,980 --> 00:28:48,250
Tao Ziyi?

521
00:28:48,860 --> 00:28:50,380
[Tao Ziyi]

522
00:28:49,850 --> 00:28:51,310
Who drew this?

523
00:28:50,380 --> 00:28:54,550
[Ye Pingjun]

524
00:28:52,160 --> 00:28:53,530
Look at what's drawn here.

525
00:28:53,530 --> 00:28:54,530
It's so funny.

526
00:28:54,550 --> 00:28:55,810
[Recognition for Outstanding Students]

527
00:28:55,510 --> 00:28:56,380
Serves her right.

528
00:28:56,380 --> 00:28:57,350
What qualifications does Ye Pingjun have

529
00:28:57,350 --> 00:29:00,210
to be rated as a grade-A student
along with Tao Ziyi?

530
00:29:15,480 --> 00:29:16,900
I heard you really

531
00:29:16,900 --> 00:29:18,380
went all out today.

532
00:29:18,440 --> 00:29:20,110
That's impressive.

533
00:29:21,420 --> 00:29:22,610
You bought that necklace today

534
00:29:22,610 --> 00:29:24,470
for Second Young Lady Tao, right?

535
00:29:25,550 --> 00:29:26,280
Make a guess.

536
00:29:26,420 --> 00:29:27,310
Again?

537
00:29:30,530 --> 00:29:32,190
You were very attentive to her

538
00:29:32,250 --> 00:29:33,770
a while ago.

539
00:29:34,980 --> 00:29:35,850
But recently,

540
00:29:35,850 --> 00:29:38,220
you've been acting
hot and cold toward her.

541
00:29:38,220 --> 00:29:39,000
I guess...

542
00:29:40,680 --> 00:29:41,270
Either

543
00:29:41,500 --> 00:29:43,030
you are playing hard to get,

544
00:29:43,200 --> 00:29:44,200
or

545
00:29:44,680 --> 00:29:46,210
you have other intentions.

546
00:29:52,980 --> 00:29:53,960
Li Boren.

547
00:29:55,110 --> 00:29:56,480
You have many flaws,

548
00:29:57,320 --> 00:29:58,850
but your biggest one

549
00:30:00,310 --> 00:30:01,710
is that you talk too much.

550
00:30:01,980 --> 00:30:02,610
Got it.

551
00:30:04,380 --> 00:30:05,790
Talk less.

552
00:30:20,180 --> 00:30:22,290
Why didn't Fifth Young Master
ask you to dance?

553
00:30:22,290 --> 00:30:23,890
I don't care if he does or not.

554
00:30:24,480 --> 00:30:26,090
When he danced with you a while back,

555
00:30:26,090 --> 00:30:28,220
it felt like you two were inseparable.

556
00:30:28,920 --> 00:30:31,850
Suddenly, he turned his back
and played with others.

557
00:30:33,980 --> 00:30:34,750
Ziyi.

558
00:30:35,460 --> 00:30:36,960
I must remind you,

559
00:30:37,850 --> 00:30:39,780
he has countless female admirers.

560
00:30:39,880 --> 00:30:41,610
He won't be not easy to control.

561
00:30:41,980 --> 00:30:43,440
You should pull out early.

562
00:30:43,920 --> 00:30:45,350
Don't fall too deep.

563
00:30:47,660 --> 00:30:49,720
It's not clear who will fall for whom.

564
00:30:51,350 --> 00:30:52,200
Sister,

565
00:30:52,700 --> 00:30:54,160
you don't understand men,

566
00:30:54,250 --> 00:30:56,660
especially men like Yu Changxuan.

567
00:30:59,000 --> 00:30:59,960
Don't worry.

568
00:31:00,460 --> 00:31:01,860
The night is still young.

569
00:31:27,850 --> 00:31:28,660
Miss.

570
00:31:29,330 --> 00:31:30,530
May I have this dance?

571
00:31:31,000 --> 00:31:32,000
It'll be my honor.

572
00:31:44,310 --> 00:31:48,110
[Xiangxi Hotel]

573
00:31:50,720 --> 00:31:51,740
After dinner,

574
00:31:51,760 --> 00:31:53,010
I'll have someone take you home.

575
00:31:53,010 --> 00:31:53,420
Okay.

576
00:32:40,030 --> 00:32:41,310
Fifth Young Master Yu made quite a splash

577
00:32:41,310 --> 00:32:42,380
at the auction.

578
00:32:42,680 --> 00:32:43,880
I wonder which beauty

579
00:32:43,880 --> 00:32:45,310
will receive the necklace

580
00:32:45,310 --> 00:32:47,370
you went to such great lengths to get.

581
00:32:54,050 --> 00:32:54,850
The necklace?

582
00:32:55,770 --> 00:32:56,770
It's for Jinxuan.

583
00:32:57,570 --> 00:32:58,270
Why?

584
00:32:59,240 --> 00:33:00,040
Do you like it?

585
00:33:04,770 --> 00:33:06,900
I wouldn't dare to claim such an honor.

586
00:33:07,460 --> 00:33:08,400
I heard

587
00:33:08,750 --> 00:33:09,850
that a few days ago,

588
00:33:10,110 --> 00:33:11,530
you bought 10 sets of

589
00:33:11,680 --> 00:33:13,380
pure gold hair ornaments

590
00:33:14,010 --> 00:33:16,470
for the leading actress
of a theater troupe.

591
00:33:17,050 --> 00:33:19,380
Yesterday, you booked a whole dance hall.

592
00:33:19,640 --> 00:33:22,480
Fifth Young Master Yu has been really busy

593
00:33:22,680 --> 00:33:24,280
treating everyone equally.

594
00:33:27,960 --> 00:33:30,310
Miss Tao,
you are usually so cold and aloof,

595
00:33:30,310 --> 00:33:32,310
not even giving me a passing glance.

596
00:33:33,180 --> 00:33:34,380
But now, you know my private affairs

597
00:33:34,380 --> 00:33:35,840
like the back of your hand.

598
00:33:37,030 --> 00:33:38,690
Second Young Lady Tao's heart

599
00:33:39,740 --> 00:33:41,250
is truly more unpredictable

600
00:33:41,250 --> 00:33:43,050
than the spring breeze in April.

601
00:34:11,850 --> 00:34:12,980
Someone's shooting!

602
00:34:12,980 --> 00:34:13,570
Ziyi!

603
00:34:13,880 --> 00:34:14,460
Ziyi!

604
00:34:16,080 --> 00:34:16,679
Run!

605
00:34:29,110 --> 00:34:29,909
Go over there!

606
00:34:42,780 --> 00:34:43,860
Mom!

607
00:34:44,670 --> 00:34:46,130
Mom!

608
00:34:50,280 --> 00:34:51,440
Don't be afraid. It's okay.

609
00:34:51,440 --> 00:34:52,679
Mom!

610
00:34:55,880 --> 00:34:57,080
Close the hall doors!

611
00:34:57,260 --> 00:34:58,190
Close the doors!

612
00:35:31,980 --> 00:35:32,640
Changxuan.

613
00:35:33,260 --> 00:35:35,260
The Tao sisters have been sent away.

614
00:35:36,440 --> 00:35:37,570
Where is Master Jin?

615
00:35:39,110 --> 00:35:40,670
Master Jin took the evening train

616
00:35:40,670 --> 00:35:42,300
to Shenyang for procurement.

617
00:35:42,300 --> 00:35:44,190
Call your Master Jin back immediately.

618
00:35:44,190 --> 00:35:45,320
He just left,

619
00:35:45,360 --> 00:35:46,070
and this Xiangxi Hotel

620
00:35:46,070 --> 00:35:47,670
becomes riddled with holes.

621
00:35:48,340 --> 00:35:49,480
Fifth Young Master Yu.

622
00:35:49,480 --> 00:35:50,320
If you ask me,

623
00:35:50,550 --> 00:35:51,650
we should arrest them all

624
00:35:51,650 --> 00:35:53,580
and interrogate them thoroughly.

625
00:35:54,360 --> 00:35:55,620
Search them one by one.

626
00:35:56,090 --> 00:35:56,750
-Yes.
-Yes.

627
00:36:07,690 --> 00:36:09,550
See who has a silver fountain pen.

628
00:36:10,010 --> 00:36:11,270
A silver fountain pen?

629
00:36:11,710 --> 00:36:12,460
The killers all had

630
00:36:12,460 --> 00:36:14,130
silver fountain pens on their chests.

631
00:36:14,130 --> 00:36:14,820
It should be a mark

632
00:36:14,820 --> 00:36:16,350
to identify accomplices.

633
00:36:18,900 --> 00:36:20,040
Indeed.

634
00:36:33,690 --> 00:36:35,690
There's a silver fountain pen here.

635
00:36:37,570 --> 00:36:38,230
Don't move!

636
00:36:41,170 --> 00:36:42,540
This pen isn't mine.

637
00:37:18,760 --> 00:37:19,900
It's you.

638
00:37:23,460 --> 00:37:24,400
You know her?

639
00:37:27,030 --> 00:37:28,960
Take her back to the headquarters.

640
00:37:29,920 --> 00:37:31,850
I'll interrogate her personally.

641
00:38:11,280 --> 00:38:12,670
Come, Miss Ye.

642
00:38:14,070 --> 00:38:15,470
Let's begin officially.

643
00:38:22,380 --> 00:38:26,160
[Nanhuai Army Headquarters]

644
00:38:36,000 --> 00:38:36,600
Enough.

645
00:38:40,150 --> 00:38:42,810
This is our headquarter's
interrogation room.

646
00:38:44,050 --> 00:38:45,630
We are very thorough with our hospitality.

647
00:38:45,630 --> 00:38:47,890
Are you still refusing to tell the truth?

648
00:38:48,500 --> 00:38:50,150
I'm telling the truth.

649
00:38:50,340 --> 00:38:52,000
I went for an interview this afternoon.

650
00:38:52,000 --> 00:38:52,860
They were short-handed,

651
00:38:52,860 --> 00:38:54,000
so I was transferred there.

652
00:38:54,000 --> 00:38:56,060
You can check if you don't believe me.

653
00:38:56,230 --> 00:38:59,760
You're not likeable when
you're not sincere in a conversation.

654
00:39:01,920 --> 00:39:04,120
Do you see that meat grinder over there?

655
00:39:04,650 --> 00:39:05,070
Come,

656
00:39:07,050 --> 00:39:08,260
put your hand in.

657
00:39:09,070 --> 00:39:10,200
Once the power is on,

658
00:39:11,130 --> 00:39:12,550
soon there will be nothing left

659
00:39:12,550 --> 00:39:14,610
but crushed bones and mangled flesh.

660
00:39:15,440 --> 00:39:17,370
Have you ever had cupping therapy?

661
00:39:21,440 --> 00:39:22,190
Tell me,

662
00:39:23,300 --> 00:39:25,230
who is the mastermind behind this?

663
00:39:26,340 --> 00:39:27,940
This is your last chance.

664
00:39:29,570 --> 00:39:31,260
I really don't know.

665
00:39:40,980 --> 00:39:41,880
Ye Pingjun.

666
00:39:42,260 --> 00:39:44,520
Class 3, Grade 2 of Mingde Girls' School.

667
00:39:44,780 --> 00:39:47,150
You live in Tianshuijing Alley
in the east of the city.

668
00:39:47,150 --> 00:39:48,670
You only have your mother at home,

669
00:39:48,670 --> 00:39:49,980
who has a chronic lung disease.

670
00:39:49,980 --> 00:39:52,150
She goes to Ren'ai Hospital
for consultations every month.

671
00:39:52,150 --> 00:39:54,010
Her attending doctor is Wang Zhiyuan.

672
00:39:54,010 --> 00:39:55,320
She has been treated for three years.

673
00:39:55,320 --> 00:39:56,610
Her condition has improved,

674
00:39:56,610 --> 00:39:57,210
but

675
00:39:57,630 --> 00:39:59,960
she still falls ill whenever it gets cold.

676
00:39:59,960 --> 00:40:00,480
Right?

677
00:40:05,510 --> 00:40:06,860
What do you want to do?

678
00:40:08,170 --> 00:40:09,000
What I want to do

679
00:40:09,000 --> 00:40:10,360
is already very clear.

680
00:40:10,760 --> 00:40:12,820
As long as you name your accomplices,

681
00:40:13,380 --> 00:40:14,440
I will be lenient

682
00:40:14,440 --> 00:40:15,630
and let you go home.

683
00:40:17,300 --> 00:40:19,760
Your mother is still
waiting for you at home.

684
00:40:25,980 --> 00:40:26,940
Calm down.

685
00:40:28,590 --> 00:40:29,920
I must calm down.

686
00:40:32,960 --> 00:40:34,960
I remember during the interview...

687
00:40:40,340 --> 00:40:41,170
Feng Yao.

688
00:40:42,090 --> 00:40:43,170
What a coincidence.

689
00:40:43,170 --> 00:40:45,100
Are you here for the interview too?

690
00:40:48,500 --> 00:40:50,960
When the interview results were announced,

691
00:40:51,460 --> 00:40:53,320
she wasn't among those accepted.

692
00:40:54,210 --> 00:40:55,700
But during the ball,

693
00:40:56,340 --> 00:40:57,280
why was she wearing

694
00:40:57,280 --> 00:40:58,410
a waiter's uniform?

695
00:41:01,150 --> 00:41:02,410
Fifth Young Master Yu.

696
00:41:03,710 --> 00:41:04,850
I have a proposal.

697
00:41:07,460 --> 00:41:08,550
A proposal?

698
00:41:08,950 --> 00:41:09,380
Yes.

699
00:41:13,320 --> 00:41:14,120
Let's hear it.

700
00:41:17,760 --> 00:41:18,780
Let me out.

701
00:41:19,230 --> 00:41:20,170
Within ten days,

702
00:41:21,440 --> 00:41:22,090
I will catch the real culprit

703
00:41:22,090 --> 00:41:23,710
who framed me.

704
00:41:34,010 --> 00:41:35,570
I didn't expect you to
still be in the mood

705
00:41:35,570 --> 00:41:36,380
to joke with me.

706
00:41:36,380 --> 00:41:37,710
I'm not joking with you.

707
00:41:38,550 --> 00:41:39,960
Since Fifth Young Master Yu
has investigated

708
00:41:39,960 --> 00:41:41,050
so thoroughly

709
00:41:41,420 --> 00:41:42,480
and knows I have a

710
00:41:42,480 --> 00:41:43,670
bedridden mother at home,

711
00:41:43,670 --> 00:41:45,600
it's impossible for me to run away.

712
00:41:46,190 --> 00:41:47,010
Within ten days,

713
00:41:47,010 --> 00:41:48,870
if I really can't find the person,

714
00:41:49,110 --> 00:41:51,640
it won't be too late for you
to arrest me again.

715
00:41:52,050 --> 00:41:53,310
Fifth Young Master Yu.

716
00:41:54,760 --> 00:41:55,980
Do you dare to bet with me?
